# Real locus fixtures

When a test covers a named catalog/sentinel site, load
`tests/fixtures/loci/<id>/` (BAM snippet + extract tables). Do not invent
split/DPE piles for that locus.

Cut new fixtures with `scripts/extract_locus_fixture.py`. Follow
`.cursor/skills/real-locus-test-fixtures/SKILL.md`.
